.SH NAME
git-work-issue-log - Print an issue's history


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgit-work issue log ID [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the issue's history: every operation, oldest first, in the shape the
store holds it. This is what a status report is generated from.
ID is an id prefix or an alias.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-f\fP, \fB--format\fP="json"
	Select the output formatting style. Valid values are [json,text]

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for log


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBgit-work-issue(1)\fP
